CORE
main.cpp
--cpp17
^\[main\.assertion\.[0-9]*\] .* direct: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.[0-9]*\] .* nested: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.[0-9]*\] .* WRONG \(must FAIL\): FAILURE$
^VERIFICATION FAILED$
^EXIT=10$
^SIGNAL=0$
--
^warning: ignoring
--
Only folds over the first pack or the function parameter pack were
expanded.  g++ 13 and clang++ 18 accept this program, and it fails only
its WRONG assertion.
